          "html": "<span class=\"fs fs2\">OVERLAY DESIGNS:</span><p><span class=\"fs fs2\">The overlay frames were designed as flexible visuals that complement the set while enhancing on-screen communication. These includes lower thirds, highlight bands, and callout pop-ups that simplify key concepts without interrupting the flow of conversation. Drawing from the same visual language as the backdrop, the overlays use bold shapes, minimal iconography with strokes, and a consistent color palette.</span></p>"
