          "t": "p",
          "html": "<span class=\"fs fs2\">SET BACKDROP:</span><p><span class=\"fs fs2\">The backdrop unfolds as a continuous, isometric illustration that captures the end-to-end journey of a seller on Flipkart Seller Hub. It spreads three panels, the composition seamlessly moves from order notification and seller onboarding to packaging, dispatch, and final delivery—using a modular, system-driven visual language with a limited color palette and clean line work.</span></p><p><span class=\"fs fs2\">PROCESS AND FINAL DESIGN:</span></p>"
